  _markup: 'One text. A few possibilities.


    Let <$tide><b><size=115%>the tide
    roll in</size></b></$tide>, add <$glitter><b><size=115%>glitter</size></b></$glitter>,
    or build up <$depth><b><size=115%>layers of depth</size></b></$depth>. Even a
    <$backplate><b>beveled backplate</b></$backplate> belongs to the text.


    <scramble
    once duration=.7 revealDuration=.6 charset=ascii seed=19>Watch these words decrypt.</scramble>


    A
    word can trigger your scene, too.


    Watch the lantern.<wait=1.4>

    <event=sample_lantern>Let
    there be light.'
