      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'One text. A few possibilities.


    Let <b><size=115%>the tide roll in</size></b>,
    add <b><size=115%>glitter</size></b>, or build up <b><size=115%>layers of depth</size></b>.
    Even a <b>beveled backplate</b> belongs to the text.


    Watch these words
    decrypt.


    A word can trigger your scene, too.


    Watch the lantern.

    Let
    there be light.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
